    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════  -->
    <!-- CORE UNIT DEFINITIONS  (edit here — everything else updates automatically) -->
    <!--   CoreUnit1 / CoreUnit2  are always granted to the player at game start.   -->
    <!--   They are excluded from banning and picking in the Roster Draft.          -->
    <!--   The draft pool (Pool1..Pool16) is filtered at runtime, so any unit you   -->
    <!--   promote to a core slot automatically disappears from the draftable pool. -->
    <!--   Ravager / Lurker / Brood Lord get a direct larva-build path (AbilData)    -->
    <!--   so they are buildable without their parent. Archon is NOT a pool pick;    -->
    <!--   it is unlocked by drafting either templar (see RosterEnforce.galaxy).     -->
    <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════  -->
